This is where we share what is happening on the ground: how literacy sessions run when a community moves with the seasons, what early developmental screening turns up in places with no specialist services, and what we are learning from the partnerships that make any of it possible.

## What to expect

Field notes from the communities we work in, updates on new reading spaces and programme cycles, and news as our first research briefs move toward publication.

We are glad you are here.
